def root_link(m):
    target = m.group(1)
    return '](' + (target[3:] if target.startswith('../') else 'resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/' + target) + ')'
handoff = re.sub(r'\]\(([^)]+)\)', root_link, body.replace('# Major step018 - gate008 data accepted; proof and transport redesign remain held', '# Current pro2 handoff - major step018'))
start = '''# Start here

Read [HANDOFF](HANDOFF.md), [checkpoint018](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_018.md) and newest [SESSION](resume-2026-09-28-001/SESSION.md).

Gate008 saved data passes independently for D177 only:5550passed/19skipped/45accepted partitions. Later D178, current admission and native are unaccepted. Finite001 encoding exceeds395799; compact design is pending. Native002 cannot fit current transport/argv limits; a separate frame design needs review.

